// A unicode space at the edge of a packed turn drops. An interior one stays.
// Ordinary program: no HOLD_FLASH line.

CUBE turn ROLE observer PROTON 1
CUBE law  ROLE nanobot  PROTON 1

PLUG turn law

IMPULSE turn 1
IMPULSE law 1
ENERGYFLOW 1
FLOW 1
HARMONY law
DECIDE law
ASSERT CUBES >= 2
PRINT "turn" UNITY DECIDE ENERGY
